{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "资源不等于安全",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 111.14,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "Move 的类型系统，保证代币对象不能被复制，也不能凭空丢掉。",
   "spoken": "Move 的类型系统，保证代币对象不能被复制，也不能凭空丢掉。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 1.691,
   "speechEnd": 6.829
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "但它不保证数学正确，不保证权限正确，也不保证升级正确。",
   "spoken": "但它不保证数学正确，不保证权限正确，也不保证升级正确。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 7.26,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 7.26,
   "speechEnd": 12.757
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "2025 年 5 月 22 日，Sui 上的 Cetus 被攻击。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 5 月 22 日，Sui 上的 Cetus 被攻击。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 13.16,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 13.264,
   "speechEnd": 17.515
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "按 Dedaub 和 Cyfrin 的分析，漏洞不在 Cetus 自己的业务代码，在它依赖的开源数学库。",
   "spoken": "按 Dedaub 和 Cyfrin 的分析，漏洞不在 Cetus 自己的业务代码，在它依赖的开源数学库。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 17.94,
   "dur": 7.6,
   "speechStart": 18.032,
   "speechEnd": 25.314
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "加流动性时，要把一个数左移 64 位。数学库先判断，这一步会不会溢出。",
   "spoken": "加流动性时，要把一个数左移 64 位。数学库先判断，这一步会不会溢出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 25.76,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 25.76,
   "speechEnd": 32.217
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "判断用的比较常量写错了。本该拦住的值，被放了过去。",
   "spoken": "判断用的比较常量写错了。本该拦住的值，被放了过去。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 32.62,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 32.62,
   "speechEnd": 37.735
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "在 Move 上，位移溢出，交易会中止吗？",
   "spoken": "在 Move 上，位移溢出，交易会中止吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 38.2,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 38.2,
   "speechEnd": 41.571
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "不会。位移溢出直接截断，交易照常执行。",
   "spoken": "不会。位移溢出直接截断，交易照常执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 42.3,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 42.394,
   "speechEnd": 46.136
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "攻击者存入约 1 个代币，拿到巨量的流动性份额，提走池子资产，约 2.23 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "攻击者存入约 1 个代币，拿到巨量的流动性份额，提走池子资产，约 2.23 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 46.52,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 46.614,
   "speechEnd": 53.779
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "Sui 验证者冻结了约 1.62 亿美元，治理投票后，转入共管多签，用于赔付。",
   "spoken": "Sui 验证者冻结了约 1.62 亿美元，治理投票后，转入共管多签，用于赔付。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 54.18,
   "dur": 7.28,
   "speechStart": 54.276,
   "speechEnd": 61.263
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "所以审计范围，必须覆盖数学依赖库。位移和乘法溢出，要有显式检查。",
   "spoken": "所以审计范围，必须覆盖数学依赖库。位移和乘法溢出，要有显式检查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 61.68,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 61.68,
   "speechEnd": 68.459
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "语言的保证，也依赖验证器本身没写错。",
   "spoken": "语言的保证，也依赖验证器本身没写错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 68.86,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 68.86,
   "speechEnd": 72.11
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "2023 年，Zellic 发现，Move 字节码验证器在处理超长函数时，漏掉了控制流边，两道安全检查被绕过。",
   "spoken": "2023 年，Zellic 发现，Move 字节码验证器在楚理超长函数时，漏掉了控制流边，两道安全检查被绕过。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 72.52,
   "dur": 8.88,
   "speechStart": 72.624,
   "speechEnd": 81.176
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "这个漏洞已修复，没有损失。",
   "spoken": "这个漏洞已修复，没有损失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 81.62,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speechStart": 81.716,
   "speechEnd": 83.515
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "协议层的风险，仍然在升级权限和部署流程。",
   "spoken": "协议层的风险，仍然在升级权限和部署流程。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 83.92,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 83.92,
   "speechEnd": 88.112
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "2025 年 9 月，Sui 上的 Nemo，开发者在审计后，私自部署了未审计的代码。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 9 月，Sui 上的 Nemo，开发者在审计后，私自部署了未审计的代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 88.54,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 88.639,
   "speechEnd": 94.405
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "一个内部的闪电贷函数被设成公开，升级权限只有单签。损失约 240 万到约 260 万美元。",
   "spoken": "一个内部的闪电贷函数被设成公开，升级权限只有单签。损失约 240 万到约 260 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 94.84,
   "dur": 9.04,
   "speechStart": 94.937,
   "speechEnd": 103.662
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "升级权限要用多签，加时间锁。部署的版本，必须等于审计的版本。",
   "spoken": "升级权限要用多签，加时间锁。部署的版本，必须等于审计的版本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 104.1,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 104.1,
   "speechEnd": 109.713
  }
